{
  "id": 469437412,
  "iid": 24135,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Fix domain ID calculation for domain 0 multicast",
  "description": "The port-based domain ID calculation used strict greater-than\n(destport > PORT_BASE) which excluded domain 0 multicast traffic\nwhere the destination port is exactly PORT_BASE (7400). Change to\ngreater-than-or-equal so domain 0 is correctly identified.\n\nThis affected implementations like Connext Micro that do not include\nPID_DOMAIN_ID or PID_RTI_DOMAIN_ID in their DATA(p), making domain\nID derivation rely entirely on the port calculation.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (GitHub Copilot, Claude)",
